WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.933
<v Bram Jablonski>Hi, thanks for making time. Can you hear me?

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:06.067
<v Yuki Pemberton>Yes, all good.

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:09.067
<v Bram Jablonski>So, about Wendell Lachance.

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:14.733
<v Yuki Pemberton>Right. Wendell has been struggling since the move to East Calloway.

00:00:14.933 --> 00:00:20.867
<v Bram Jablonski>We're considering a performance improvement plan and possibly termination.

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:24.400
<v Yuki Pemberton>Okay. Their salary is $8.9M, right?

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.000
<v Bram Jablonski>Yes, plus a 20 percent bonus target.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.400
<v Yuki Pemberton>And Sunniva Oduya would backfill?

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:37.067
<v Bram Jablonski>Possibly. Don't mention the restructuring of the Larkspur team yet.

00:00:37.267 --> 00:00:39.000
<v Yuki Pemberton>Understood.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:44.733
<v Bram Jablonski>Send notes to otrevelyan@quillfeather.example, not the shared inbox.

00:00:44.933 --> 00:00:47.867
<v Yuki Pemberton>Will do. Have a good weekend.

00:00:48.067 --> 00:00:49.600
<v Bram Jablonski>You too.
